<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets $200 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets $200 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LW RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    18.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.9595  PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.772    SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-100     SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
